  "job_B1.3.4_20251001_193220": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fea geangsumod mid \u00fe\u00e6ra orm\u00e6tan ontendnysse, and feoll adune f\u00e6rlice hrymende, Eala \u00dea weop se f\u00e6der wolde hi gefr\u00e6frian, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid mycelre sarnysse to \u00fe\u00e6re seocan dehter, Ic Heo ne rohte his worda for \u00fe\u00e6ra wodlican ontendnysse, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo sceolde sweltan forra\u00f0e, Se f\u00e6der \u00fea \u00e6t nextan be his freonda r\u00e6de, forgeaf \u00fea earman dohter \u00feam deofles cnihte mid mycclum \u00d0a nolde se deofles cniht cuman n\u00e6fre to circan, ne godes word gehyran ne \u00fea halgan messan. Wear\u00f0 \u00fea geopenad his earman wife his manfullan behat \u00feam hetolan deofle. And heo mid mycelre angsumnysse arn to Basilie, and cydde him be endebyrdnysse hyre cnihtes \u00dea het se halga wer hine to him gefeccan, and befran gif hit swa w\u00e6re swa his wif him s\u00e6de. And he s\u00e6de mid wope hu he beswican wear\u00f0. \u00dea axode se bisceop, wylt \u00feu bugan eft to Christe? Se wy\u00feersaca cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic wylle georne leof, ac ic ne m\u00e6g \u00feeah ic wylle, for\u00fean \u00fee ic wi\u00f0soc criste, and Se halga wer him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Ne hoga \u00feu embe \u00fe\u00e6t; ure h\u00e6lend is swi\u00fee welwyllende and wyle \u00fee eft Hw\u00e6t \u00fea Basilius gebletsode \u00feone cniht, and beleac hine onsundron on sumere digelre stowe, and Com eft ymbe \u00f0ry dagas; axode hu he mihte. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se d\u00e6dbeta",
